# Vortx audience (all eight market segments)

Vortx sells **public-record legal intelligence** to every segment below. Marketing copy, outbound posts, and sales conversations must speak to **their job** and **their hook**, not generic "risk teams" only.

Full reference: `docs/AUDIENCE.md`. Runbook: `VORTX_RUNBOOK.md` (Audience section).

## Scope split (marketing vs product)

| Surface | Rule | Segments |
|---------|------|----------|
| **Marketing, growth, outbound** | This file | All eight below |
| **In-app product** (Litigation Lightning dashboard) | `Vortx-Litigation-Lightning.mdc` | B2B subscription only — debt collectors, law firms, credit/risk, competitive intel |

- No prediction markets, wagering, or casino-style UI in the product.
- Retail/trader/TikTok angles are **awareness and lead gen** only — route to free queue, pricing, or B2B tiers; never in-dashboard speculation features.
- Segment 8 (Credit & vendor risk) is the **primary in-app buyer**; segments 1–7 drive top-of-funnel and enterprise discovery.

